cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  航天服务星具身智能机械臂机器人 (Space Service Robot with
  Embodied Intelligence)
message: >-
  If you use this work — the digital prototype, the mechanical/electrical
  design package, or the free-floating dynamics evidence base — please cite it
  as below.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: vehiclewaxberry
    email: areospacevehicle@gmail.com
    # TODO: replace `alias` with `given-names` / `family-names` (and add
    # `affiliation` / `orcid`) before using this file for a formal citation.
repository-code: 'https://github.com/vehiclewaxberry/Space-Embodied-Robot-Complete'
abstract: >-
  A 12U CubeSat servicing spacecraft with a B601 6-DOF manipulator, developed
  for capture of tumbling non-cooperative targets (150 kg debris and a 22 kg
  target satellite) under free-floating dynamics. The repository contains the
  complete digital prototype (SolidWorks native and STEP), the mechanical,
  electrical/harness, power/thermal and propulsion design package, and a
  machine-adjudicated simulation evidence base covering free-floating arm
  reaction, capture impulse, ANCF flexible-panel excitation, detumble actuator
  budget, mission feasibility and capture-strategy feasibility.
keywords:
  - on-orbit servicing
  - space robotics
  - cubesat
  - free-floating manipulator
  - non-cooperative capture
  - flexible multibody dynamics
  - ANCF
  - embodied intelligence
  - robotic-manipulator
  - spacecraft mechanical design
version: '2026.09.21'
date-released: '2026-09-21'
